      "text": "- Checks col ONLY. Row is not checked;\nthat's step 2b.\n- Gives C's spot only, not A's or B's.\n- Every thread gets a unique spot,\nso no 2 thread write the same element;\nthat's why we cant pass col in.\n- Our row/col variables hold the same numbers;\nwe need them for A and B.",
      "fontSize": 17.499999999999993,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Checks col ONLY. Row is not checked;\nthat's step 2b.\n- Gives C's spot only, not A's or B's.\n- Every thread gets a unique spot,\nso no 2 thread write the same element;\nthat's why we cant pass col in.\n- Our row/col variables hold the same numbers;\nwe need them for A and B.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
